# DATA 266 Lab 2 — Parts 2 and 3 GPU container: TOP-LEVEL requirements (DECISIONS.md D-089).
# Installed ON TOP of pytorch/pytorch:2.14.1-cuda13.0-cudnn9-runtime. torch / torchvision / triton / CUDA
# libraries come from the base image and are protected by a constraints file generated at build time
# (they are never upgraded or replaced). The fully resolved, exact versions are in requirements-p2p3.lock.txt.
#
# Reference versions = the versions that passed the local Mac smoke tests (D-063, D-085). They are
# re-verified here by a pip dry-run resolution before installation (D-089); they are not proof of GPU correctness.

